      "problem": "Simplify $\\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }{1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta }.$",
      "worked_solution": "Using the identity $1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ,$ we rewrite and simplify the expression as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }{1+{cot}^{2}⁡\\theta } & =\\frac{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta }{{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta \\cdot \\frac{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$",
